Henry: Hey Lily, tera landline par try kiya lakein koi jawab nahi tha .pehle se hi chala gaya? mujhe batao ki ham kab baat kar sakte hai Lily: shahar ja rahi hun Henry: THEEK HAI Henry: isse pehle ki hum baat kara: main kal gali mein william se takra gaya aur hum ek pub chale gaye. Poor chappy! sach mein. woh apne nuksaan se ubar nahi payega.En passant inne agle hafte Reihen ke liye humari yatra ka ullekh kiya aur abhaas kiya ki woh saath le jaakar khush hogi. tum kya sochte ho? Henry: mainne socha ki yah hamaare lie bahut maayane nahin rakhata hai aur vah achchhee kampanee hai, achchhee kampanee se baat karatee hai. aur vah kampanee, usake aasapaas puraane doston ke lie prasiddh kee tarah lagata hai. aap jaanate hain ki mera kya matalab hai. Henry: aur yah krisamas se pahale hamaara achchha kaam ho sakata hai! ;) Lily: Traffic bahut dheema tha, lekin main vaastav mein javaab nahin de sakti thi. abhi lecture mein hun. Lily: mai humesha William ko like kiya, mujeh koi problem nahi hai woh humare saath Riehen jaane mein join karne ka. How do you imagine that? Henry: vah FR par ayega, apani car ko meri drive mein chord dega aur khadaan mein hum aapko le jayenge. Lily: bahut badiya.hum shuru karne se pehle mere ghar par ek coffee Henry: maine socha ki shayad baad mein ek saath bhojan kiya jaye? Lily: aur bhee behatar. mujhe woh pasand hai! usse umr ke lie nahin dekha, isaliye use phir se milne kee khushi hai. Lily: kya tum yah sab arrange karoge? Henry: zaroor. lekin taiyaar ho jao: woh vrddh ho gaya hai. abhi kaaphee dikhai de raha hai. Lily: lekin i hope mentally nahin? Henry: nahin, intellectually bilakul nahin. lekin uske chaaron aur yah udaasee hai. An air of depression. Lily:hum usse khush karenge. Bas ek din ke liye ho toh.Ab khatam karna hai. Cheers!
