Bill: No offense man, but aajkal tumhari tendencies hai to make poor choices Richard: Kya baat kar rahe ho? Bill: Tum ghar baithna pasand karte ho humse milne ke bajaye, when we rarely see each other. Bill: Jab ek dream job tere darwaze pe knock karti hai, terko recruiting process mein part nahi lena because tujhe tv series dekhni hai Bill: Finally, when your girls want to take next step and move to you, tu usko kehta ai it's not the best idea? Bill: Kya chal raha hai tere saath ? Richard: Mere paas apne reasons hai. Bill: Koi reason justify nahi kar sakta that you are a lazy piece of shit little brother. Agar tum ye change nahi karoge, tumhein mushkil wakt dekhna padega zindagi mein Bill: Yaad rakhna jo main kahu apni gaand kaam pe lagao. Bill: Because jab parents tumhe unke money se cut off karenge, you will suffer.  Richard: Chudwa le Bill. Ye tera business nahi hai. Bill: WTF Bill? Bill: I'm your fucking brother! Of course ye mera business hai. Richard: Merko ye conversation nahi karna hai abhi. Bill: Kabhi achcha samay nahi hota tumhare paas to listen to someone older and wiser. Richard: Wiser? Tumhe lagta hai you're a wise person that's worth to listen? Bill: Ok. Bye Richard. Main ummeed karta hu you get your head clean of this shit you smoke. Richard: Bye
