Jeff: Yo! Kuch puch sakta hu? Daniel: Sure! Jeff: Last time tumse baat karne ke baad, I decided to check the books you recommended. Daniel: Discworld series? Jeff: Haan. Daniel: So what do you want to know? Jeff: Itne saare hain ki I don't know kahan se shuru karun! Daniel: I know boht useful advice nahi hai but I would start at the beginning :P Jeff: Very funny... Daniel: I'm serious. Daniel: Discworld series ke liye boht saare "recommended" patterns hain . Daniel: But for me answer boht simple hai. Daniel: Pehli book se start karo and follow the order in which they were released. Jeff: Toh log alag approach kyun suggest karte hain? Daniel: Discworld mein boht saare sub-series hain. Daniel: Rincewind, Witches, City Watch, Death and so on. Daniel: Kuch log waise padhna prefer karte hain to focus on one set of characters. Jeff: Okay but tumko abhi bhi lagta hai ki I should read sab kuch in order? Daniel: That is what I did. Daniel: Especially that kai characters hain jo boht saare series mein aate hain. Daniel: So that way you won't miss anything. Jeff: Oh samjh gaya. Jeff: I'll just follow your advice. Daniel: No problem. Daniel: I really think, tumko ye achhi lagegi.
