Tina: Hi love, you Ok? Sally: Haan! Just got back from hols, boht maza aaya, weather bhi mast tha! Tina: God, yes you have! Heatwave ke beech mein, brilliant timing! Sally: Haan, British summer ke liye unusual bhi tha! We had some lovely days out too. Tina: Kahan kahan gayi? Sally: Widemouth Bay, Sandymouth Bay, Cambourne, Bodmin Railway, Seaton Trams, PeccoRama. Tina: Sounds like kaafi kuch kiya! Sally: Haan, Bude ke paas bhi thode din ke liye the, udher there are lovely second hand bookshops, pasties everywhere etc. Oh haan, ek-do rowing boat trips bhi ki! Tina: Oh, I love being out on the water! Sally: We discovered we're not seafaring folk! Sabse pehle hum log pedalo boat pe gaye, par I was too fat for it aur front heavy ho gaya, toh mujhe utarna pada, main almost gir hi gayi utarte time and had to crawl out on my stomach. Tina: That must have looked funny! Sally: haan..thoda embarrassing tha! Next time, hum logo ne rowing boat try kia, but we were hopeless at rowing! Then Mitch hit his head on the wooden seat, usko itna dizzy feel ho raha tha ki hospital jana pada. Luckily, concussion nahi hua. Decided to give boats a miss after that. Tina: No wonder! Still, lovely ki overall toh you enjoyed it. Bye, love! Sally: Bye! is week gym mein milte hain? Tina: Hope to, waaps 2 or 3 times a week chaalu karna padega! Sally: I know, me too! See you!
