Quentin: Aaj unboxing mein aa rahe ho?  Tarquin: Tumhe firse koi delivery hui ? Quentin: Haan. And as usual mujhe koi idea nahi hai unne kya bheja hai. Tarquin: Tumne Facebook par event banaya ? Quentin: Haan I did. Dekha nahi tumne? Tarquin: Kaafi time se chalaya nahi hai maine. Actually mujhe ban kardia for making a joke which offended someone. It involved a penguin, joki tumhe pata hai can be a very offensive topic. Quentin: I don't know. Ajakl log boht sensitive hain, but are ignorant anyway. Tarquin: So will you have a good crowd for the unboxing?  Quentin:Seven to pakka. I will do some wine and cheese and boxes kholna 8 bje shuru kar sakte hain Tarquin: Sounds great. Mai aunga.  Quentin: Great. Tarquin: Kya lagta hai, kitni books hongii? Quentin: About 200, usbaar ki tarah. Tarquin:Kitni biki on the spot?  Quentin: sirf 30, baaki went to the shop. But prices better hain than the labels I would put on them, especially jab impromptu chal raha ho. Nigel ko hamesha Helen ko outbid karna achha lagta. Maine helen ko pretend karne bola ki she is interested in more books than she really is just to keep Nigel getting his wallet out. Tarquin: Hah hah! Wo toh khush hogi ye karne mein.  Quentin: Naturally. Top sort, that Helen. Tarquin: Konsi book thi jispe they were bidding so hard over last time? Quentin: Oh. Wo Simon Sebag Montefiore ki book hai Stalin par. I think mere paas teen copies hai shop mein uski 10 zlotys each par. Tarquin: Akhir mai Nigel ne kitna pay kiya? Quentin: 52 zlotys in the end. Mai Mushkil se apni smile rok paa rha tha. Tarquin: But it's really only the fun and games I think. Usse pata hoga he was overpaying and just doing it for a lark, because of the social evening. Quentin: Haan Shayad. Which is why I like to be generous with the wine and cheese. Khaskar ke wine, I might add. Tarquin: Yes. Wo Peter ki company ki hai right? Quentin: haan. And mai crates ka order le sakta hu at a special "Quentin price" only on the evening of the unboxing. Aaj raat bhi karunga , if you want anything for Christmas wine-wise.
