Sam: Hi Leah, tumhara favourite former student bol raha hu! kaise ho ? Leah: Sam! kaise ho? How's Uni going? Sam: It's amazing! Mujhko apna naya ghar aur dost kaafi pasand aaye aur course bhi !  Leah: Oh, suun kar kaafi achha laga. I know what it's like to have dodgy flatmates, from bitter experience! Sam: Well, term ke starting mein kuch vegans the flat mein, but they decided to leave mid-Oct. We didn't argue or anything though. Hamare burger addiction se ,wo log boht disturbed rehte the, isliye shaanti se kahin aur chale gaye.  Leah: Vegans are people too!  Sam: Yes, maybe! Anyway, College kaisa chal raha hai? Leah: Hectic as always! Jon abhi bhi humko entertain karta hai apne guitar se aur freestyle rapping se! Sam: Oh yes, I remember jab hum sab studio mein kaam karte the and him singing Bowie songs when he died. It wasn't bad! Leah: Haan, uske singing se problem nahi hai, but the rapping is another story! I think wo college mein practise karta hai because it annoys his wife too much! Sam: ðŸ˜„ Leah: Mujhko lagta hai Bristol me rap battle me 3rd aane pe usko dil se bura lagaa !umeed karta hu tum mehnat kar rahe hoge! Sam: bilkul kar raha hu mai, Leah, 3 deadilines hai meri iss mahine aur ek cinema job bhi hai. iss mahine party karne ka time hi nahi! Leah: I can't believe it, Sam! When I was in Poly it was all raves and glowsticks!  Sam: I'd love to have seen you then! It's not the 90s anymore, Leah! Abhi fees hai, loans hain, and no grant! It's work, work work now! Leah: I'm just kidding, I know what my nephew goes through. Sam: maine abhi kuch naye illustrations banaye hai. Vo instagram pe hai, agar tumko pata hai instagram kya hai? Leah: Cheek! I'm not over the hill yet! I'll check them out. Sam: maine kuch book ke covers dekhe jo tumne banaye the , kaafi achhe the! Leah: Yes, my heady days as a freelancer. Kabhi kabhi yaad aate hain, then I think of the money... Sam: Well, it's a precarious profession, isn't it? I've got all this to come. Leah:Come for a chat in the hols. I'll dig out my old contacts book, give you a few names. Sam: Thanks Leah. agle mahine milte hai . Bye! Leah: Bye Sam. See you soon!
