Liz: Hello Laurien, Humne tera cottage book kardia hai via airbnb beginning next Monday.Kya tum Raasta bataoge ? Laurien in Buxton: Hello Liz and Terry! That's correct and the cottage is easy to find. Actually mai khud abhi jaane waali hu 1 hour mai, so the simplest way will be that I'll send you Share My Location from there to your Whatapp. To Map jaise lagega, Chalega kya ? Liz: Thank you, Haan isse kaam ho jayega. But to be on the safe side, Kya tum address bhi dedoge ?car navigation ke lie. Laurien in Buxton: Haan of course but jyada fark nahi padega. Saare navigation systems fail to find it . But mai apne local pub ka address deti hu, waha se it's only 3,6 miles to my cottage. The Kings Table on Quarnford, Buxton SK17 0SN. Once you are there, Wildboardclough ki taraf jao, it's signposted, and you are soon on the map. Liz: Well thoda complicated hai but we'll give it a try. Kya hum pub jaake raasta puch sakte hai, just in case? Laurien in Buxton: Koi na! Just mention Oldhagsboards to the publican and wo raasta bata dega. He's my nephew and mai boldungi you'll be coming. Liz: Splendid! I don't think hum raatke pehle pahuch paunga. Laurien in Buxton:Jab tak you're in the pub before last orders, Sab sai hoga :)) Liz: And a pint at the end of a long drive will be welcome too! Thank you Laurien. Laurien in Buxton: You'll be alright. And don't hesitate to contact me agar you need something. I usually reply within half an hour. Liz: Very kind of you. Thank you!
