"Fair: Hi there. Good morning. Play: Hi. Not so sure about the morning though. Fair: Kyu? Kya hua? Play: Bahut cheeze. Fair: Jaise? Play: Jaise you just woke me up! Fair: Come on. It's almost 10 am. Play: Accha aisa ? Then I went to bed just 2 hours ago? Fair: What? Puri raat kya kia ? Play: You don't want to know. Fair: Of course, I do. Bataoo! Play: Nothing fun. I assure you. Fair: I took all night. Must be interesting! Play: All right, then. I'll tell you. Fair: Kya hua? Play: You remember this gorgeous blond,Jo mere upar rehti hai? Fair: I sure do. She looks like a model! Play: She went out last night and forgot to shut the water in her bathroom. Fair: Mazzak nahi sachhi ?. Play: Not at all.Pur raat i used all the towels flood rookne ke lie"
"Mike: Please aake kuch apples le ja we picked way too many! Zelda: Ooh, apples! Sure! Mike: We went a little overboard... Zelda: LOL!Mai mom ke bhi lelunga if you want? Mike: Please do! No idea hum kya soch rahe the! Zelda: It was a nice day, you were in an orchard, to why not? Mike: Exactly! Now! Apple overload! Zelda: Tum applesauce banalo. It freezes nicely. Mike: Good idea. How do I do that? Zelda: Just peel, core and cut up the apples, put in a pan with sugar and let it cook low and slow down to applesauce. Mike: Asaaan lag raha hai! Zelda: You can add cinnamon if you wish or leave it plain. Mike: Accha. Zelda: Usko ek sweet side dish ki tarah use karlo with pork or savory by mixing it with bbq sauce. Mike: Kabhi socha nahi tha! Zelda: Have I just excluded myself from free apples? LOL! Mike: No, not at all, but like the idea. Thanks!"
