Drew: Koi khabar aayi? Alan: Nahi, Vo abhi tak soch rahe hai. Drew: tum lagta hai ki vo dusre offer ke sath jaayenge? Alan: Ho sakta hai, par mujhko lagta hai humara waala offer jyada better hai. humne similar conditions diye, but we did waive home inspection. Aur short closing bhi diya humne. Drew: Question is if they are eager to make a short transaction. jo bhi ho home inspection genious tha. Alan: I know, we'll be ripping the place to studs anyway.  Drew: and we budgeted quite a large contigency for surprises. And we do want considerable structural changes. Alan: we do.  Alan: Unko decision Jaldi le lena chahiye.  Drew: I hope so. not knowing makes me crazy...
Melanie: Angie, kal raat True Detective dekha? Angelica: Nahi, abhi tak to nahi, episode kaisa tha? Melanie: Oh, kaafi badhiya. As usual you must follow bohot sara details but it's rewarding. Angelica: Ok! koi major events or revelations? Spoiler free please. Melanie: Let's say kaafi kuchh hua. :D
Elle: I'm quiting Emma: what? why? Emma: Hua kya?? Elle: Office ka atmosphere unbearable hai! Emma: fir tumhare boss ne kuch kiya? Elle: Haan  Emma: Tum kisi aise insaan ko nahi jaanti jiske paas hum ye incidents report kar sake? Elle:Jaanti hu par vo bhi unse aisa hi dara hua hoga jaise ki hum hai Emma: dammit that's not right Elle: :( Emma: Well then CVs bhejna start kar do Elle: you think? Emma: Job toh tumko yun hi mil jaaegi!!
Sam: Ye mark Gungor kaun hai? Leigh: I've seen his speech on the nothing box. youtube pe dekh. It's both hilarious and true. Kris: I think I know the one. A lot of buzzing? ;) Leigh: That's him! :) Kris: Unka podcast bhi hai? Leigh: Haan ! tumko net pe aasani se mil jaayega. Sam: Just watching! Super funny! Kris: Any other ideas? Sam: tumne Spotify try kiya? Kris: I already told u. I'm not looking for music. Leigh: No, no, Sam is right! Kris: Kaise? Sam: Spotify ne recently podcast ko apni library me add kiya hai. mujhko lagta hai tumko udhar kuch mil jaayega.  Kris: Rly? All the time I was paying 4 Premium I didn't see it. Leigh: Kyunki Vo feature recently hi add hua hai. Maine bhi usko try nahi kiya. Sam: Neither have I, but I know it's there. Kevin: Thanks! Will try both!
Heather: Hey, kya mai tumse ek question poochu? Barry: Shoot Heather: kya tum god me believe karte ho? Barry: Yeah, of course. You know my views. Heather: Yeah, but I guess what I'm getting at is kyun? Barry: Well, I'm a Christian, and the Bible is the authority in my life. Heather: Ok, lekin aur bhi kai saare religions hai. And of course there are agnostics, atheists, etc. Barry: You just have to follow your heart. Agar Tum kuch dhoondh rahe ho , bhagwan Tumko sahi raasta dikhayenge . At least that's what I think. Personally, the Bible mere morality ke perception se align karti hai. The Bible is like a guidebook for our lives. Jitna zada tum uske principles ko follow karoge, utni better tumhari life hogi, and you'll be blessed by God. Heather: Agar Bible itni hi sahi hai, To itne saare muslims kyun hai duniya me? Barry: I can't answer that question. God ke paas plan hai iss world ke liye, aur kabhi kabhi ye accept karna padta hai ki hum saare answers nahi jaan sakte. I put my faith in God and the Bible. I'm sure tumhare paas bhi Bible hogi. Usey padhna shuru karo and God will surely speak to you. Agar tum interested ho, you can always come to my church. If you need some encouragement, there are some pretty nice single guys :) Heather: Oh come on. I'm not gonna go to church to meet Mr. Right. Barry: Kyon nahi? Vo perfect place hai life partner se milne ke liye, and I'm being serious. Heather: tab tumahri life partner kidhar hai? :) Barry: Well, let's just say, God is teaching me patience these days ;) Heather: Oh, I see. Barry: But seriously. I sincerely invite you to come with me this Sunday. No pressure. We have lots of cake after service :) Heather: Ok, Mai tumko bta dungi. Barry: Talk to you soon. Mai tumhare liye pray karunga :)
Dan: Hi Jack, kya mai tumhare ghar aa sakta hu khelne ke liye Jack: Don know, Mom se puchunga Dan: please ask her for mini choc rolls! Jack: mum ne kaha tum aa sakte ho Dan: Mini roll? Jack: Yes!
Felicity: Hi, Gene. kya tumne ye polish movie dekhi? Gene: kaunsi Polish movie? Felicity: It's called Cold War. Nominated for Oscars. Gene: Nahi, I wouldn't mind though. Felicity:Aaj raat chalte hai, the show is at 8. Gene: Cool. Pick you up at 7:30.
Mat: Aaj hum bahar jaa rahe hain babe? Kim: i dont feel like going out Bas kaam ke baad ghar jaana hain mujhko Mat: i know recently sab boht tough raha hai, you gonna feel so much better promise Kim: well i dont know Mat: wanna check that new restaurant out? achha dinner karke seedhe ghar chalenge Kim: ok fine Mat: great! Mai 2 logon ke liye table book kar dunga. 6 fine with u? Kim: it is. kya tum mujhe pick up kar sakte ho? Mat: 5.30? Kim: love u Mat: love u too
Serena: Have you been to the doctor lately? Jeff: Nahi, kyun? Serena: Just wondering what he says about your skin condition? Jeff: Abb thik hai.  Serena: That's good! Jeff: The cold weather sets it off and if I eat too much of the wrong foods, but otherwise theek hai. Serena: So dawa nahi leni padti tumhe? Jeff: Not all the time. Why? Serena: Tina ko bhi same cheez hai aur vo daily meds leti hai. Jeff: Usko kuchh different type hoga or something worse. Serena: Shayad. Jeff: It sucks, but it doesn't have to be every day. Serena: That's good. I'll tell her. That will cheer her up! Jeff: Good! Tell her to hang in there. She can call me if she has any questions. Serena: Thanks!
Gabriella: Hey wassup? How's life/work/the pursuit of happiness and the like? Derek: Chizein ok hai idhar. Tum batao? Gabriella: Maine apni car bech di aur ek nayi kharid li. Ahem, bought an almost equally puraani car. Cuh-razz!!! winter break mein kya kar rahe ho? Derek: Hey, wow, cool. Itni jaldi kaise bechi? Kaunsi khareedi? Casey is sick. 2 weeks mein we're going to Cieszyn. Gabriella: 2005 Mercedes b class. Casey ko kya hua? What's in Cieszyn? Derek: Is it a sedan, hatchback, station wagon? Next week bachchon ka hockey day camp hai aur fir 2-din ki hockey training hai Cieszyn me. Hum raat bhar wahi rukenge. Gabriella: Hatchback. To tum ek week me jaa rahe ho? Ali ka day camp hai next week and I'll work from home because of the hours and the following week we are meeting Tasmin in Berlin. I sold it for 9000. Derek: I'd probably get like 3 for mine. Gabriella: Maine "nayi" car kharid li 10 me, but it has some rust. Derek: That's pretty good. Does it burn less? Gabriella: Supposedly 6 on the highway. Derek: That's pretty good. kidhar se mili tumko vo? Gabriella: Olx, mere mechanic ne kaha ki engine great hai. It's quite small outside and big inside. Derek: Cool. I'd like to see it. Gabriella: Next time jab hum milenge lunch ke liyr to I'll show it to you. Derek: Ok, see ya.
